@startuml
title Python ETL Pipeline - Architecture

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

cloud "Google Cloud Platform\n\n" {
  component "Cloud Scheduler" as Scheduler
  component "Cloud Run Jobs" as ETL
  database "BigQuery" as BQ
}

cloud "External Service" {
  component "Public API" as API
}

Scheduler --> ETL : Trigger scheduled execution
ETL --> API : 1. Extract data
ETL --> ETL : 2. Transform and validate
ETL --> BQ : 3. Load transformed data

@enduml